G3705:
ὅραμα, -τος, τό
 (ὁράω), [in LXX for חָזוֹן, מַרְאֶה, etc. ;] 
that which is seen; 
 __(a) a sight, spectacle: Mat.17:9, Act.7:31; 
 __(b) an appearance, vision: Act.9:10, 12 (Rec.) Act.10:3, 17 10:19 11:5 12:9 16:9-10 18:9 (cf. ὀπτασία).†
 (AS)

G3709:
ὀργή, -ῆς, ἡ 
 [in LXX chiefly for אַף, also for חָרוֹן, חֵמָה, קָצַף, etc. ;] 
__1 1, impulse, propensity, disposition. 
 __2. anger, wrath; 
 __(a) of men: Mrk.3:5, Eph.4:31, Col.3:8, 1Ti.2:8, Jas.1:19-20; 
